# Apps (actions/actions_apps.kbd)
**apps + spc**      -- App Finder (RA-spc)
**apps + !lctl**    -- Recent Files (recent_files.sh)
**apps + 0**        -- Chrome Misc
**apps + 1**        -- Chrome Mgmt
**apps + 2**        -- Chrome Cloud
**apps + 3**        -- Chrome Ai
**apps + 4**        -- Chrome Banks
**apps + 5**        -- Chrome Misc1
**apps + 6**        -- Chrome Misc2
**apps + 7**        -- Chrome Misc3
**apps + 8**        -- Chrome Misc4
**apps + 9**        -- Chrome Colab
**apps + c**        -- Claude Code
**apps + e**        -- Fileexplorer
**apps + f**        -- Firefox
**apps + k**        -- Keepassxc
**apps + m**        -- Chrome
**apps + o**        -- Obsidian
**apps + s**        -- Sketchup
**apps + t**        -- Terminal
**apps + v**        -- Nvim
**apps + w**        -- Zapzap
**apps + x**        -- Calc
**apps + lsft + 0** -- Firefox Misc
**apps + lsft + 1** -- Firefox Mgmt
**apps + lsft + 2** -- Firefox Cloud
**apps + lsft + 3** -- Firefox Ai
**apps + lsft + 4** -- Firefox Banks
**apps + lsft + 5** -- Firefox Misc
**apps + lsft + 9** -- Firefox Colab
**apps + lsft + f** -- Fusion360
**apps + lsft + k** -- Okular
**apps + lsft + o** -- Onlyoffice
**apps + lsft + t** -- Telegram
**apps + rsft + o** -- Orcaslicer
